# Netlify redirects for selling303.com
# Processed top-to-bottom; first match wins.
# Netlify serves existing static files before applying 200 rewrites,
# so Astro-generated pages (e.g. /neighborhoods/highlands-ranch) are unaffected.

# --- Clean URLs ---
# /index → / rule removed 2026-05-18: Netlify serves dist/index.html for the /index
# request before the redirect runs, so the rule never fired. Canonical handles dedup.
/home        /           301

# --- Sitemap canonicalization ---
# Astro's @astrojs/sitemap emits /sitemap-index.xml + /sitemap-0.xml; the legacy
# /sitemap.xml does not ship. Without this, GSC and external services hitting
# /sitemap.xml directly hit a 404. Added 2026-05-18 (dead-infra audit).
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 301

